am_url，播放这个url，可以边生成边收听。\\n当模型为mureka-o1时，不支持该模式。\\n"}},"additionalProperties":false,"$defs":{}}}','1','0','0',3,1,NOW(),'system','核验账号权限、全部SKU价格及外币汇率后启用' FROM aid_ai_provider p WHERE p.provider_code='mureka' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM aid_ai_model m WHERE m.model_code='mureka-9.5');
