e styles and musical directions that should not be present in this section. Use English language for best result."},"duration_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":3000,"maximum":120000,"description":"The duration of the section in milliseconds. Must be between 3000ms and 120000ms."},"lines":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","maxLength":200},"description":"The lyrics of the section. Max 30 lines per section and max 200 characters per line."},"source_from":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/SectionSource"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Optional source to extract the section from. Used for inpainting."}},"required":["section_name","positive_local_styles","negative_local_styles","duration_ms","lines"],"title":"SongSection","additionalProperties":false},"CompositionPlanChunksItems":{"oneOf":[{"$ref":"#/$defs/GenerationChunk-Input"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/AudioRefChunk"}],"title":"CompositionPlanChunksItems"},"SectionSource":{"type":"object","properties":{"song_id":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100,"description":"The ID of the song to source the section from. You can find the song ID in the response headers when you generate a song."},"range":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TimeRange","description":"The range to extract from the source song."},"negative_ranges":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TimeRange"},"description":"The ranges to exclude from the ''range''."}},"required":["song_id","range"],"title":"SectionSource","additionalProperties":false},"GenerationChunk-Input":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":6132,"description":"The text config to be generated for this chunk. Can contain an optional section name in square brackets at the beginning, e.g. [Verse 1], lyrics lines, and inline directions in curly braces, e.g. {scratching}. Section names must be between 1 and 100 characters. At most 30 lines are allowed, each at most 200 characters."},"duration_ms":{"type":"integer","minimum":3000,"maximum":120000,"description":"The duration of the chunk