ed `output_format`, with `content_type` reporting what was actually delivered — alongside the clean `audio`. Free of charge. Requires mode=async. Separation runs after generation and typically adds 2-6 min to the wait and gives up after 30 min; that ceiling is reached by a retry or a busy queue rather than by track length, so do not size a client timeout off the duration. It never fails the task: if separation fails, `audio` is unaffected and the response carries `stems_error` — on its own, or alongside the streams that did separate.","required":false}]}],"rules":[],"presentation":{"supportsTextInput":false,"maxOutputCount":10,"defaultOutputCount":1}}',0,NOW(),'system' FROM aid_ai_model m JOIN aid_ai_provider p ON p.id=m.provider_id WHERE m.model_code='sonilo-music-api' AND p.provider_code='sonilo' AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM aid_ai_model_capability x WHERE x.model_id=m.id AND x.capability_code='post_text_to_music');
